      "id": "claim_cccdf3f811b940be9f1f794c6f713184",
      "statement": "The SDK's create_deep_agent configures a compiled graph with recursion_limit 9,999, and dcode subsequently copies its resolved effective recursion limit into that graph configuration, allowing the dcode value to override the SDK value even when it equals LangGraph's inherited default.",
